  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/fire/flame-burning-hand-purple.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Right after you cast Divine Smite, the module offers to spend Channel Divinity on one effect: <strong>Dao's Crush</strong> (the target is Grappled and Restrained - escape DC = your spell DC, by hand), <strong>Djinni's Escape</strong> (your next move is a 30-ft teleport, and until the end of your next turn you have Resistance to Bludgeoning, Piercing and Slashing and can't be Grappled, Prone or Restrained), <strong>Efreeti's Fury</strong> (2d4 Fire to the target and 2d4 Fire to another creature within 30 ft) or <strong>Marid's Surge</strong> (the target and chosen creatures within 10 ft make a STR save or are pushed 15 ft and knocked Prone).</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
